<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Liberty Holdings yr shr up, div increased.</title>
<headline>Liberty Holdings yr shr up, div increased.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     1,886.1	vs     1,506.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		   900.0	vs     700.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     901.7	vs     714.6</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	1,645.3	vs     1,297.9</p>
<p>    Minority interest	 734.6	vs     572.0</p>
<p>Div payable April 4</p>
<p>on register March 27</p>
<p>Full name: Liberty Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Shareholders may elect to receive capitalisation shares in lieu of a dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
